# .clinerules
Project and Environment Rules:
- Platform: Ubuntu on WSL2. Execute all commands using standard bash syntax.
- Monorepo Structure:
  - Root: Orchestration only (docker-compose.yml, .gitignore, README.md). Never place standalone app logic in the root.
  - backend/: Python service.
  - frontend/: Client application.
- Backend Toolchain:
  - All Python commands must run in the backend/ directory using uv.
  - Dependencies: cd backend && uv add <package>
  - Execution: cd backend && uv run <command> (e.g., uv run ruff check, uv run pytest)
  - Never invoke raw pip install or python -m venv.
- Frontend Toolchain:
  - All frontend commands run in the frontend/ directory using the specified package manager.
- Containers:
  - Native WSL2 Docker. Do not prefix docker or docker compose with sudo.
- Version Control:
  - Make atomic git commits after completing each milestone.